<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Vos billets sont prêts</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f5f5f5; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    .header { background: #6c3de0; padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333; line-height: 1.6; }
    .ticket-card { border: 2px solid #6c3de0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 16px 0; text-align: center; }
    .ticket-number { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .ticket-event { font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #1a1a1a; }
    .ticket-category { color: #6c3de0; font-weight: bold; margin: 4px 0; }
    .ticket-date { color: #555; font-size: 14px; }
    .qr-img { margin: 16px auto; display: block; max-width: 200px; }
    .seat { background: #f3f0ff; border-radius: 4px; padding: 6px 12px; display: inline-block; font-size: 13px; color: #4c1d95; margin-top: 8px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; margin: 24px 0; padding: 14px 32px; background: #6c3de0; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; }
    .info { background: #f0fdf4; border-left: 4px solid #22c55e; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: 13px; color: #166534; margin: 16px 0; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 32px; background: #f9f9f9; color: #999; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header"><h1>BilletiX</h1></div>
    <div class="body">
      <h2>Vos billets sont prêts ! 🎟</h2>
      <p>Bonjour {{firstName}},</p>
      <p>Votre paiement a été confirmé. Voici vos billets pour :</p>
      <p style="font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:#6c3de0;">{{eventName}}</p>
      <p style="color:#555;">{{eventDate}} — {{eventVenue}}</p>

      {{#each tickets}}
      <div class="ticket-card">
        <div class="ticket-number">Billet #{{this.ticketNumber}}</div>
        <div class="ticket-event">{{../eventName}}</div>
        <div class="ticket-category">{{this.categoryName}}</div>
        <div class="ticket-date">{{../eventDate}}</div>
        {{#if this.seatInfo}}<div class="seat">Siège : {{this.seatInfo}}</div>{{/if}}
        <img class="qr-img" src="{{this.qrCodeUrl}}" alt="QR Code billet {{this.ticketNumber}}" />
      </div>
      {{/each}}

      <div class="info">Présentez le QR code à l'entrée de l'événement. Chaque QR code est unique et à usage unique.</div>
      <a href="{{ticketsUrl}}" class="btn">Voir mes billets</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">© {{year}} BilletiX — Tous droits réservés</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
